rids in Clarke County has a record from 1951 to 2025. In that span August to September came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle saw Jan-Feb at 51% of normal and June to July at 156%. Every grid had its driest year in 1988, with grid 25044 at 46%.</p>"}
